WEBVTT


00:00:00.701 --> 00:00:03.870
¶


00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:38.671
[Screaming/Chaos]


00:00:58.859 --> 00:01:01.327
[Hercules Yells]
MAGERA!


00:01:06.567 --> 00:01:08.701
[Hercules Yells]
MAGERA!


00:01:12.673 --> 00:01:14.640
[Hercules Yells]
MAGERA!


00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:30.890
[Hercules Yells]
MAGERA!


00:01:30.892 --> 00:01:33.893
[Magera Whispers]
Shhh...Quiet.


00:01:36.063 --> 00:01:37.964
[Cup Shatters]


00:01:58.251 --> 00:02:00.553
What has happened to you?


00:02:01.355 --> 00:02:02.722
Please no!


00:02:02.724 --> 00:02:08.461
[Screaming]


00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:20.906
[Hercules Screaming]


00:02:25.779 --> 00:02:28.914
[Hercules Yelling/Sobbing]
MAGERA!


00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:35.788
[Screaming]
MAGERA!


00:02:38.992 --> 00:02:42.862
[Screaming]


00:03:30.777 --> 00:03:36.048
[Grunts]
[Swords Colliding]


00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:37.616
Not bad.


00:03:40.921 --> 00:03:42.521
[Grunts]


00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:51.597
[Grunts]
[Sword Colliding]


00:03:51.599 --> 00:03:52.398
Cyrus: General.


00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:53.999
Arias: Impressive.


00:03:54.001 --> 00:03:55.668
You fight like a girl.


00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:58.137
Ah, like a girl, huh?


00:03:58.139 --> 00:04:02.775
[Grunts/Swords Collide]


00:04:12.018 --> 00:04:19.892
[Grunts/Swords Collide]


00:04:21.628 --> 00:04:24.597
Looks like [Heavy Breathing]
you just been beaten by a girl.


00:04:24.599 --> 00:04:26.732
[Laughing]


00:04:26.734 --> 00:04:28.567
Do you yield?


00:04:31.271 --> 00:04:33.072
I yield.


00:04:35.108 --> 00:04:36.709
Impressive, Horace.


00:04:36.711 --> 00:04:39.111
Except that I lost.


00:04:39.113 --> 00:04:41.781
No shame in losing to the best.


00:04:41.783 --> 00:04:44.150
You arrogant bastard.


00:04:44.152 --> 00:04:47.586
[Clapping]


00:04:47.588 --> 00:04:50.422
Nothing wrong with arrogance...


00:04:50.424 --> 00:04:53.926
as long as it coexists
with talent.


00:04:53.928 --> 00:04:55.995
Which it does with you, Arias.


00:04:56.930 --> 00:04:59.331
See my influence in every move
that you make.


00:04:59.333 --> 00:05:02.835
Which is why, I am making you my
new captain.


00:05:02.837 --> 00:05:03.803
You mean...


00:05:03.805 --> 00:05:06.705
Yes! I'm promoting you,
my friend.


00:05:06.707 --> 00:05:08.207
Thank you, General.


00:05:08.209 --> 00:05:10.009
Scoundrel.


00:05:10.011 --> 00:05:11.610
So, it's true.


00:05:11.612 --> 00:05:13.679
And you said it was just
a rumor.


00:05:13.681 --> 00:05:16.916
If we were all born leaders, then
there would be no followers.


00:05:16.918 --> 00:05:19.385
Wouldn't you agree, Horace?


00:05:19.387 --> 00:05:21.287
[Theodora]
Did I miss the match?


00:05:21.289 --> 00:05:23.022
Yes you did, my love.


00:05:23.024 --> 00:05:24.490
[Theodora
Who won?


00:05:24.492 --> 00:05:26.559
I did, of course!


00:05:26.561 --> 00:05:29.895
Well, tell her the great news!


00:05:29.897 --> 00:05:31.664
Great news? Well, what is it?


00:05:31.666 --> 00:05:34.166
I have just been promoted
to Captain.


00:05:34.168 --> 00:05:37.136
-Congratulations!
-Thank you.


00:05:41.007 --> 00:05:44.210
Alright you two,
save it for the wedding.


00:05:44.212 --> 00:05:48.647
Forgive me, Horace. I didn't mean to
offend your prudish sensibilities.


00:05:48.649 --> 00:05:51.884
Prudish? You should know me
better then that.


00:05:51.886 --> 00:05:53.285
[Laughs]


00:05:54.688 --> 00:05:56.121
So, the two of you shall wed?


00:05:56.123 --> 00:05:58.023
Yes.


00:05:59.192 --> 00:06:03.562
And as best man, I can only
say... she should be wedding me.


00:06:03.564 --> 00:06:05.097
[Laughs]


00:06:05.765 --> 00:06:06.999
Are you hungry?


00:06:07.001 --> 00:06:09.335
My mother has invited you all
to a feast.


00:06:09.337 --> 00:06:10.870
To celebrate our engagement.


00:06:10.872 --> 00:06:12.338
Sounds delightful.


00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:16.008
I will attend. See you then.
Horace.


00:06:16.010 --> 00:06:17.776
General


00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:22.915
Horace: Good riddance.
Arrogant aristocrat.


00:06:22.917 --> 00:06:24.216
Theodora: Horace!


00:06:24.218 --> 00:06:26.118
Arias: He's just jealous.


00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:30.723
Please. Jealous of that donkey
in a General's outfit?


00:06:30.725 --> 00:06:32.191
[Theodora Laughs]


00:06:32.193 --> 00:06:35.327
He was born of a silver spoon
in his mouth.


00:06:35.329 --> 00:06:39.164
I just don't understand your
blind devotion to Nikos.


00:06:43.336 --> 00:06:45.838
How many times do we have to
speak about this?


00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:49.108
Apparently, a few more until you
will listen to reason.


00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:51.877
Queen: What exactly is
reasonable about conquering


00:06:51.879 --> 00:06:53.913
a completely peaceful village?


00:06:53.915 --> 00:06:58.284
If you want a reason to attack
Haon, I can give you thousands.


00:06:58.286 --> 00:06:59.585
Millions.


00:06:59.587 --> 00:07:02.454
King: The gold in their mines,
is that your reason?


00:07:02.456 --> 00:07:05.124
Yes. Of course.


00:07:05.126 --> 00:07:06.859
They're discovering
more each day,


00:07:06.861 --> 00:07:09.361
and their people are growing
wealthier and wealthier.


00:07:09.363 --> 00:07:10.362
While we--


00:07:10.364 --> 00:07:12.398
[King Interrupts]
While we what?


00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:13.599
Starve?


00:07:13.601 --> 00:07:17.303
King: Is there not enough food
on your plate?


00:07:17.305 --> 00:07:21.206
Unlike you, your grace,
I know what it's like to be poor.


00:07:21.208 --> 00:07:25.744
And if we do not expand,
we will end up that way again.


00:07:25.746 --> 00:07:30.482
I am not going to attack a village
and overthrow it's leaders


00:07:30.484 --> 00:07:32.651
simply to attain its riches,


00:07:32.653 --> 00:07:36.789
and to claim some things
that we have no right to have.


00:07:36.791 --> 00:07:41.360
That gold belongs to whoever has
the might and will to take it.


00:07:41.362 --> 00:07:42.328
To you.


00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:44.430
To us.


00:07:44.432 --> 00:07:46.498
We have to do it now,
while we have the power.


00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:50.336
Queen: What power we have comes from
the fact that our people respect us.


00:07:50.338 --> 00:07:51.870
That will work for us.


00:07:51.872 --> 00:07:55.274
We risk losing everything,
for what?


00:07:55.276 --> 00:07:56.909
A few gold nuggets?


00:07:56.911 --> 00:08:00.012
Who are you to lecture me about greed
while you sit here on your royal--


00:08:00.014 --> 00:08:03.248
[King Interrupts Yelling] Who are you
to talk to your Queen like that?!


00:08:05.352 --> 00:08:08.287
Forgive my insolence,
your Highness.


00:08:08.289 --> 00:08:10.990
This meeting is adjourned.


00:08:10.992 --> 00:08:12.858
Leave now!


00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:14.293
Gladly.


00:08:36.182 --> 00:08:37.549
Am I interrupting?


00:08:37.551 --> 00:08:38.751
Cousin!


00:08:38.753 --> 00:08:39.551
Ah!


00:08:39.553 --> 00:08:40.519
[Laughs]


00:08:40.521 --> 00:08:43.522
Iona, dear,
a plate, huh?


00:08:43.524 --> 00:08:47.159
Do not bother, Iona.
Thank you.


00:08:47.161 --> 00:08:48.193
Erasmus.


00:08:48.195 --> 00:08:51.897
I'm to have dinner with the King
and the Queen this evening.


00:08:51.899 --> 00:08:55.834
I wouldn't expect you to dine
with common folk like us then.


00:08:55.836 --> 00:08:57.536
I have news I wanted
to share with you both.


00:08:57.538 --> 00:08:59.838
Theodora is not with child
already, is she?


00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:00.839
Tymek!


00:09:00.841 --> 00:09:02.941
Of course not.


00:09:02.943 --> 00:09:06.278
I'm to be made captain
in the King's army.


00:09:08.415 --> 00:09:11.984
-Congratulations. -Thank you.
-I'm proud of you, cousin.


00:09:11.986 --> 00:09:14.987
You know the army could use a man
with your leadership qualities.


00:09:14.989 --> 00:09:17.423
You'd have to point a sword
at my back.


00:09:17.425 --> 00:09:19.525
I'm quite happy where I am.


00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:39.411
Isn't it beautiful?


00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:42.347
Only rivaled by your beauty.


00:09:54.427 --> 00:09:55.828
Arias.


00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:56.895
Tell me.


00:09:57.764 --> 00:10:00.399
Are you looking forward
to the wedding?


00:10:00.401 --> 00:10:03.836
I think of nothing else.


00:10:03.838 --> 00:10:05.971
Why would you even ask?


00:10:05.973 --> 00:10:09.374
Well...I know men value
their bachelorhood.


00:10:09.376 --> 00:10:12.111
Who told you that, Horace?


00:10:12.113 --> 00:10:14.046
[Laughs]
Maybe.


00:10:14.048 --> 00:10:17.015
Well, he is hardly
the expert on love.


00:10:17.017 --> 00:10:21.186
[Laughs]
And what makes you an expert?


00:10:21.188 --> 00:10:24.289
I have loved you
since I met you.


00:10:24.291 --> 00:10:26.458
That is years ago.


00:10:28.928 --> 00:10:31.897
And I am blessed
by the gods.


00:10:43.009 --> 00:10:46.445
Nikos: We knew this day
would come!


00:10:46.447 --> 00:10:51.917
Nikos: A day when we would seize back
our power and reclaim our kingdom!


00:10:51.919 --> 00:10:57.656
King Demetrius is weak, and our
people have fallen into despair.


00:10:57.658 --> 00:11:04.463
If he is unwilling to do anything,
then we must take control of our own fate.


00:11:04.465 --> 00:11:08.066
We must stand together and take
back what is rightfully ours!


00:11:08.068 --> 00:11:14.239
[Cheering]


00:11:14.241 --> 00:11:16.041
Today...


00:11:16.043 --> 00:11:18.577
We shall show our might...


00:11:18.579 --> 00:11:23.015
And I shall lead Enos
into the future.


00:11:23.017 --> 00:11:29.087
Know this, we must destroy
before we can rebuild!


00:11:29.089 --> 00:11:33.225
Mercy is for the weak!


00:11:33.227 --> 00:11:34.593
Brothers!


00:11:34.595 --> 00:11:35.928
Take Arms!


00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:37.563
[Cheering]


00:11:37.565 --> 00:11:39.364
This is your destiny!


00:11:39.366 --> 00:11:43.068
[Cheering]


00:11:45.238 --> 00:11:52.511
[Chaos Outside]


00:12:05.525 --> 00:12:07.292
What is that?


00:12:11.364 --> 00:12:13.232
We're being attacked!


00:12:15.335 --> 00:12:17.035
I have to find Horace
and the others.


00:12:17.037 --> 00:12:19.071
And see what is happening.


00:12:19.073 --> 00:12:20.272
Let me come with you.


00:12:20.274 --> 00:12:21.173
No.


00:12:21.175 --> 00:12:22.341
I'm scared.


00:12:22.343 --> 00:12:24.576
It is far too dangerous.


00:12:24.578 --> 00:12:26.378
Stay with your family.


00:12:30.516 --> 00:12:32.184
Be careful.


00:12:32.186 --> 00:12:36.722
I shall return soon. If for some reason
I shall not, you have to flee.


00:12:36.724 --> 00:12:39.358
Go to my cousin Tymek's,
he will help you.


00:12:45.398 --> 00:12:52.871
[Chaos]


00:13:10.156 --> 00:13:11.390
Father!


00:13:11.824 --> 00:13:13.592
What is happening?


00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:16.461
I don't know my dear.


00:13:29.776 --> 00:13:31.977
[Groans]


00:13:36.449 --> 00:13:38.550
You two, run! Run!


00:13:41.187 --> 00:13:42.387
Hide you two, hide!


00:13:42.389 --> 00:13:44.122
Go, Go!


00:13:52.265 --> 00:13:54.399
What's this?


00:13:54.401 --> 00:13:56.535
I'm reliving you
of your command.


00:13:56.537 --> 00:14:00.372
This is outrageous!
I will not allow that!


00:14:00.374 --> 00:14:02.107
No.


00:14:02.109 --> 00:14:04.276
I did not think you would.


00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:09.314
Queen: Demetrius!


00:14:10.049 --> 00:14:11.750
Queen: Demetrius!


00:14:16.656 --> 00:14:19.157
The townspeople will never
respect your rule.


00:14:19.159 --> 00:14:21.259
They do not have to respect me.


00:14:21.261 --> 00:14:25.664
They will live by my rule,
or they will die.


00:14:31.904 --> 00:14:34.272
I know what I choose.


00:14:34.274 --> 00:14:36.775
Queen: Demetrius.
[Theodora Gasps]


00:14:46.652 --> 00:14:54.326
[Chaos]


00:14:59.565 --> 00:15:00.565
You!


00:15:00.567 --> 00:15:01.867
[Grunts]


00:15:01.869 --> 00:15:04.169
What on Earth are you doing?
These are civilians.


00:15:04.171 --> 00:15:05.837
[Grunts]


00:15:05.839 --> 00:15:06.905
Horace: Arias!


00:15:06.907 --> 00:15:09.274
[Grunts]


00:15:09.276 --> 00:15:11.710
Two against one,
that's not very fair.


00:15:17.216 --> 00:15:23.989
[Grunts]


00:15:32.432 --> 00:15:34.666
These are Nikos' soldiers.


00:15:34.668 --> 00:15:37.969
Do you still think your mentor
is a man of honor?


00:15:37.971 --> 00:15:41.306
I'm sure there must be
an explanation.


00:15:41.308 --> 00:15:43.575
Then let's go find out.


00:15:48.881 --> 00:15:50.649
Cut off their heads.


00:15:52.285 --> 00:15:53.952
Hang them on the city gates.


00:15:53.954 --> 00:15:56.388
[Theodora Crying]


00:16:12.104 --> 00:16:17.209
[Screaming]


00:16:17.977 --> 00:16:20.545
Princess.


00:16:34.293 --> 00:16:37.329
Over the mountain, in the city
of Sagev...


00:16:37.331 --> 00:16:38.730
Yes?


00:16:38.732 --> 00:16:43.735
It is rumored that the man known
as Hercules resides there.


00:16:43.737 --> 00:16:45.403
Hercules...
[Men Laughing]


00:16:45.405 --> 00:16:47.339
Hercules again.


00:16:47.341 --> 00:16:50.342
Arias, those are just stories
from our youth.


00:16:50.344 --> 00:16:52.344
People have seen him.


00:16:52.346 --> 00:16:54.846
People other then General Nikos?


00:16:54.848 --> 00:16:58.550
Hercules has been known to aid
to those in need.


00:16:58.552 --> 00:17:01.720
He has the strength of 20 men.


00:17:01.722 --> 00:17:03.855
Maybe we could convince him
to join our cause.


00:17:03.857 --> 00:17:05.790
[Distant noise outside the door]


00:17:06.626 --> 00:17:07.792
Oh, Tymek.


00:17:07.794 --> 00:17:09.494
Peace, Brothers.


00:17:09.496 --> 00:17:11.429
-Have you got news from the castle?
-I have.


00:17:11.431 --> 00:17:13.899
Although, you're going
to wish I hadn't.


00:17:13.901 --> 00:17:15.000
It's the King and Queen.


00:17:15.002 --> 00:17:16.835
-Alive?
-I'm afraid not.


00:17:16.837 --> 00:17:19.804
The King by Niko's hand,
and the Queen by her own.


00:17:19.806 --> 00:17:21.106
Treachery.


00:17:22.208 --> 00:17:25.277
Their heads are posted on stakes
outside the castle gates.


00:17:25.279 --> 00:17:26.144
And the Princess?


00:17:26.146 --> 00:17:27.612
-She's alive.
-She's safe?


00:17:27.614 --> 00:17:29.447
Afraid not, cousin.


00:17:29.449 --> 00:17:31.917
Nikos has her.
She's being held captive.


00:17:31.919 --> 00:17:36.288
That's it! With or without you,
I'm going in.


00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:38.390
I will not allow it.


00:17:38.392 --> 00:17:41.393
If you get killed, how does that
help Theodora?


00:17:41.395 --> 00:17:43.395
Fine.


00:17:43.397 --> 00:17:45.630
But then we're going to Sagev.


00:17:47.366 --> 00:17:49.034
And we will find Hercules.


00:17:49.036 --> 00:17:50.068
I'll go with you.


00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:52.804
No! Tymek.
You stay with your family.


00:17:52.806 --> 00:17:55.373
Gather as many men as you can.


00:17:55.375 --> 00:17:57.542
Lead the resistance!


00:17:57.544 --> 00:18:00.412
Keep the people's hope alive.


00:18:02.014 --> 00:18:03.949
We're with you, cousin.


00:18:04.784 --> 00:18:05.750
Good Luck.


00:18:05.752 --> 00:18:07.085
All of you.


00:18:07.087 --> 00:18:08.520
And to you, Tymek.


00:18:08.522 --> 00:18:10.488
We're gonna need it.


00:18:23.336 --> 00:18:25.437
Good people of Enos!


00:18:26.072 --> 00:18:28.540
I am your new King!


00:18:30.776 --> 00:18:34.346
Where is Arias Dudunakus?


00:18:37.416 --> 00:18:41.786
Bring him forth and you will be
rewarded greatly.


00:18:41.788 --> 00:18:48.560
If you do not,
you will be punished, greatly.


00:18:50.496 --> 00:18:54.432
I assure you,
I am a man of my word.


00:18:54.434 --> 00:18:55.734
Villager: General?


00:18:56.369 --> 00:18:57.502
Sir?


00:18:58.204 --> 00:19:00.105
Your Highness.


00:19:01.707 --> 00:19:04.042
Forgive me, you Highness.


00:19:04.044 --> 00:19:06.845
I have seen your man, Arias,


00:19:06.847 --> 00:19:09.848
flee the village
with some other men at dawn.


00:19:24.897 --> 00:19:26.564
Arias!


00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:33.538
Show yourself, or I will spill this
man's blood as surely as I stand here!


00:19:42.615 --> 00:19:44.949
Your hero has left you.


00:19:47.453 --> 00:19:52.624
[Gasps/Screams]


00:19:52.626 --> 00:19:55.727
Remember this day.


00:19:55.729 --> 00:19:58.930
Remember this man's fate.


00:19:59.699 --> 00:20:01.599
Do not defy me.


00:20:20.219 --> 00:20:23.755
Horace: It's hard to believe
any Demigod would live here.


00:20:25.458 --> 00:20:28.626
He's here.
I feel it.


00:20:31.297 --> 00:20:32.964
He has to be.


00:20:37.737 --> 00:20:39.871
Where shall we start?


00:20:42.208 --> 00:20:43.808
Gentlemen.


00:20:59.358 --> 00:21:02.060
By the gods...


00:21:02.062 --> 00:21:06.498
I do not think there's any gods
in here.


00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:08.600
Maybe not even half-gods.


00:21:09.235 --> 00:21:10.902
He looks like a beast.


00:21:10.904 --> 00:21:12.904
Ask him.


00:21:12.906 --> 00:21:15.673
Perhaps he's the half god
you're looking for.


00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:23.982
We're looking for a man named
Hercules!


00:21:24.984 --> 00:21:27.018
And who might you be?


00:21:30.256 --> 00:21:33.124
I'm Arias Dudunakus from Enos.


00:21:33.126 --> 00:21:36.261
I'm looking for a man named
Hercules.


00:21:36.263 --> 00:21:41.199
I have a handsome purse for the
man who claims to know him.


00:21:41.201 --> 00:21:43.968
Anyone here named Hercules?


00:21:45.638 --> 00:21:47.739
[Slurring]
I am Hercules!


00:21:49.642 --> 00:21:51.843
[Slurring]
No! I am Hercules.


00:21:51.845 --> 00:21:52.644
You?


00:21:52.646 --> 00:21:54.379
Of course you are.


00:21:55.948 --> 00:21:58.750
I am the real Hercules!


00:21:58.752 --> 00:22:01.052
Now give me your purse.


00:22:01.054 --> 00:22:08.860
[Crowd]
I am Hercules! I am Hercules!


00:22:14.633 --> 00:22:16.901
At least you found your army.


00:22:16.903 --> 00:22:22.173
I just hope your handsome purse
can afford so many Demi-Gods.


00:22:23.676 --> 00:22:28.913
Bartender: Quiet you fools!
Spend you coins or go!


00:22:30.316 --> 00:22:38.122
[Crowd Continues]
I am Hercules. I am Hercules.


00:22:40.392 --> 00:22:44.262
Farewell, Herculeses.
It's been a pleasure.


00:23:04.016 --> 00:23:06.184
Here she is, Dominus.


00:23:07.219 --> 00:23:09.020
She's been cleaned as ordered.


00:23:09.022 --> 00:23:12.190
-Leave us.
-Yes, Dominus


00:23:17.897 --> 00:23:19.898
Sorry to put you here.


00:23:21.333 --> 00:23:23.968
It's hardly befitting
of a Queen.


00:23:32.378 --> 00:23:34.379
I will not hurt you.


00:23:34.381 --> 00:23:36.714
[Screams]
[Slaps]


00:23:36.716 --> 00:23:38.917
Never...!


00:23:38.919 --> 00:23:40.818
...do that again.


00:23:45.224 --> 00:23:48.026
You should know better
than to strike a King.


00:23:48.028 --> 00:23:50.862
You are not my King.


00:23:52.831 --> 00:23:54.933
[Whispers]
How wrong you are.


00:23:54.935 --> 00:23:59.837
Just because you push me away does not
mean I will not take what I want.


00:23:59.839 --> 00:24:02.674
You will pay for what
you have done, Nikos.


00:24:02.676 --> 00:24:05.310
By the gods,
you will pay.


00:24:07.212 --> 00:24:11.149
Your gods have no power over me.


00:24:12.217 --> 00:24:16.387
They will strike you down,
but through Arias.


00:24:16.389 --> 00:24:21.392
They will send him here
to end this and end you.


00:24:23.028 --> 00:24:25.096
[Whispers]
Where is your Arias?


00:24:27.266 --> 00:24:29.667
[Stern]
Where is your Arias?


00:24:30.569 --> 00:24:33.071
[Yelling]
Where is your Arias?


00:24:34.239 --> 00:24:37.375
I just know that he will return.


00:24:40.346 --> 00:24:41.913
Yes.


00:24:43.716 --> 00:24:45.416
He will return.


00:24:46.218 --> 00:24:48.286
Not to save you.


00:24:49.021 --> 00:24:50.989
Or his village.


00:24:51.890 --> 00:24:54.292
Or even to kill me.


00:24:56.195 --> 00:24:59.130
He will return to bow
at my feet.


00:25:01.400 --> 00:25:08.072
He will bow at my feet,
and I shall have his head.


00:25:08.074 --> 00:25:15.513
[Theodora Crying]


00:25:21.453 --> 00:25:25.356
[Drunk Mumbling] That wench took my coins.
I saw you, you stinkin' whore.


00:25:25.358 --> 00:25:27.925
I'll be back tomorrow.


00:25:27.927 --> 00:25:34.365
[Grunt]


00:25:34.367 --> 00:25:39.037
Don't come back until you've paid your
bloody debt, you filthy drunken dog!


00:25:41.440 --> 00:25:47.278
[Grunts]


00:25:52.017 --> 00:25:54.919
[Burps]


00:26:01.393 --> 00:26:04.062
Take my hand, friend.


00:26:04.064 --> 00:26:05.363
Get away from me.


00:26:05.365 --> 00:26:07.031
You are drunk.


00:26:07.033 --> 00:26:09.033
That I am.


00:26:12.137 --> 00:26:15.339
Now leave me be,
before I...


00:26:15.341 --> 00:26:17.975
[Vomiting]


00:26:17.977 --> 00:26:19.744
[Burps]


00:26:22.581 --> 00:26:24.482
Charming.


00:26:24.484 --> 00:26:25.850
[Spits]


00:26:25.852 --> 00:26:30.421
Lead me to Hercules, and I shall
pay your debt at the bar.


00:26:30.423 --> 00:26:32.390
I am Hercules.


00:26:32.392 --> 00:26:34.826
The fruit of Zeus's loins.


00:26:37.062 --> 00:26:39.130
Now, give me some coins.


00:26:39.965 --> 00:26:43.234
Arias, this man
is a worthless drunk.


00:26:43.236 --> 00:26:46.104
This whole town is worthless.


00:26:46.106 --> 00:26:49.240
Come, let us find some sleep


00:26:49.242 --> 00:26:51.142
and be done with this
in the morrow.


00:26:51.144 --> 00:26:52.410
[Burps]


00:26:52.412 --> 00:26:55.847
We need to find Hercules
to fight General Nikos.


00:26:55.849 --> 00:26:58.483
We'll find another way, Brother.


00:26:58.485 --> 00:27:03.454
Hercules: [Slurring]
I am Hercules. I am Hercules.


00:27:04.590 --> 00:27:07.291
[Aggressive]
I am Hercules!


00:27:08.527 --> 00:27:11.229
I am Hercules!


00:27:11.231 --> 00:27:13.197
Of course you are, friend.


00:27:13.199 --> 00:27:16.067
Sleep it off, Hercules.


00:27:31.917 --> 00:27:34.452
You know I've done you a favor.


00:27:38.957 --> 00:27:42.059
Arias will never be as powerful
as me.


00:27:47.099 --> 00:27:51.569
In time I will skill you,
in ways to love me.


00:28:00.379 --> 00:28:03.247
[Gate Opens]


00:28:04.183 --> 00:28:06.317
I said not to disturb me.


00:28:06.319 --> 00:28:09.554
We know where Arias
and his men are.


00:28:09.556 --> 00:28:11.923
They left for Sagev.


00:28:15.961 --> 00:28:18.062
Send the regiment immediately.


00:28:18.064 --> 00:28:20.131
Your Highness.


00:28:25.637 --> 00:28:28.306
Don't worry...


00:28:28.308 --> 00:28:30.308
You will love me.


00:28:31.376 --> 00:28:37.815
[Theodora Crying]


00:28:39.718 --> 00:28:42.520
You know nothing of love.


00:28:46.124 --> 00:28:48.526
I know everything of love.


00:28:50.362 --> 00:28:53.064
Everything I do...


00:28:53.066 --> 00:28:56.367
everything I've done,
is for love.


00:28:58.270 --> 00:29:00.471
You think me incapable.


00:29:03.742 --> 00:29:07.545
It was once one I loved
so much,


00:29:07.547 --> 00:29:10.281
when she chose another...


00:29:10.983 --> 00:29:13.417
I killed her.


00:29:14.753 --> 00:29:19.557
That...is how deep I love.


00:29:34.106 --> 00:29:35.573
Iona: How where the mines today?


00:29:35.575 --> 00:29:38.509
It's unpleasant work
under the best conditions.


00:29:38.511 --> 00:29:42.680
But with Niko's men in charge...
They even refused us water.


00:29:42.682 --> 00:29:45.716
[Man Screaming]


00:29:45.718 --> 00:29:47.652
What's that?


00:29:47.654 --> 00:29:50.254
They still seek Arias.


00:29:50.256 --> 00:29:53.557
That's the sound of men being
tortured for information.


00:29:53.559 --> 00:29:55.760
Is there anything
that you can do?


00:29:55.762 --> 00:29:57.461
What would you have me do?


00:29:57.463 --> 00:29:59.664
If I try to help,
they'll just torture me, too.


00:29:59.666 --> 00:30:01.666
What if that doesn't work?


00:30:01.668 --> 00:30:03.501
Your cousin's plan.


00:30:03.503 --> 00:30:07.038
What if Hercules
is what Horace says he is.


00:30:07.040 --> 00:30:09.140
A myth.


00:30:09.142 --> 00:30:12.143
We cannot live
under these conditions.


00:30:12.145 --> 00:30:15.780
Our son cannot grow up...
under tyranny.


00:30:20.085 --> 00:30:22.186
Nor will he.


00:30:39.137 --> 00:30:42.506
The traitors of Enos
are in there.


00:30:55.120 --> 00:31:00.925
[Snoring]


00:31:04.663 --> 00:31:07.198
[Door Opens]


00:31:11.703 --> 00:31:13.571
Take the traitors to the street!


00:31:13.573 --> 00:31:18.275
[Grunts]


00:31:29.888 --> 00:31:36.927
[Crying]


00:31:53.645 --> 00:31:55.446
You are lead by the wrong man,


00:31:55.448 --> 00:31:57.081
General Nikos means only bad
for Enos.


00:31:57.083 --> 00:31:58.949
Silence!


00:31:58.951 --> 00:32:02.453
The gods are against you
today.


00:32:02.455 --> 00:32:04.655
For the crime of treason.


00:32:06.158 --> 00:32:07.925
General Nikos...


00:32:07.927 --> 00:32:09.427
now...


00:32:09.429 --> 00:32:10.895
King of Enos...


00:32:10.897 --> 00:32:15.366
Hereby sentences...you to death!


00:32:15.368 --> 00:32:17.935
You have betrayed Enos.


00:32:17.937 --> 00:32:20.304
And for that...


00:32:20.306 --> 00:32:22.740
you'll die!


00:32:22.742 --> 00:32:24.742
Mount arms!


00:32:24.744 --> 00:32:27.378
[Screaming]


00:32:31.183 --> 00:32:33.617
[Yelling]


00:32:38.824 --> 00:32:45.229
[Swords Colliding]


00:32:45.231 --> 00:32:46.597
[Screaming]


00:33:00.312 --> 00:33:08.118
[Swords Colliding]
[Grunts]


00:33:22.667 --> 00:33:27.238
[Yelling]


00:33:28.440 --> 00:33:30.975
[Laughing]


00:33:35.113 --> 00:33:39.717
[Breathing Heavily]


00:33:39.719 --> 00:33:41.852
I am Hercules.


00:33:45.023 --> 00:33:48.259
I'm Arias. This is Horace.


00:33:52.264 --> 00:33:53.898
What do you know
of General Nikos?


00:33:53.900 --> 00:33:56.300
Ah, yes, Nikos.


00:33:56.302 --> 00:33:58.335
He is the one we are after.


00:33:58.337 --> 00:33:59.637
Or...


00:33:59.639 --> 00:34:02.406
The one who's after us?
Depending on how you look at it.


00:34:02.408 --> 00:34:04.542
He trained you, right?


00:34:04.544 --> 00:34:06.577
Is that what he told you?


00:34:06.579 --> 00:34:08.712
So, you know of him, then?


00:34:08.714 --> 00:34:12.349
Let's just say I have more of a
reason to kill him than you.


00:34:12.351 --> 00:34:13.717
Then you will help us?


00:34:24.095 --> 00:34:25.963
[Gate Opens]


00:34:30.035 --> 00:34:32.102
Your Highness.


00:34:32.104 --> 00:34:35.506
It was ordered
that you must eat and--


00:34:36.741 --> 00:34:38.709
By the gods!


00:34:38.711 --> 00:34:40.244
Your highness!


00:34:41.680 --> 00:34:49.453
[Gagging]


00:34:55.493 --> 00:35:02.366
[Heavily Breathing]


00:35:06.404 --> 00:35:11.241
[Coughing]


00:35:14.746 --> 00:35:20.184
[Gasping]


00:35:26.658 --> 00:35:33.998
[Cough/Gasping/Screaming]


00:36:14.172 --> 00:36:17.074
[Knocking]


00:36:17.076 --> 00:36:18.409
Princess Theodora.


00:36:18.411 --> 00:36:20.711
Arias said that if anything bad
happened to come here.


00:36:20.713 --> 00:36:21.779
Please, help me.


00:36:21.781 --> 00:36:23.781
Please, come in.


00:36:23.783 --> 00:36:25.416
Tymek!


00:36:26.751 --> 00:36:27.818
Tymek!


00:36:27.820 --> 00:36:28.619
Princess!


00:36:28.621 --> 00:36:30.688
Praise the gods, you've escaped!


00:36:30.690 --> 00:36:32.189
What's happened?


00:36:32.191 --> 00:36:35.125
[Sobbing]
Where's Arias? I need Arias.


00:36:35.127 --> 00:36:37.561
He's gone to Sagev.


00:36:38.163 --> 00:36:40.431
-Why?
-To find Hercules.


00:36:40.433 --> 00:36:45.636
[Sobbing]


00:36:45.638 --> 00:36:47.871
You're safe now.


00:36:47.873 --> 00:36:49.873
Arias will be back soon.


00:36:49.875 --> 00:36:51.175
[Crying]


00:36:53.111 --> 00:36:55.579
Horace: So, Hercules...


00:36:55.581 --> 00:36:58.015
Horace: Why did you decide
to save us?


00:36:58.017 --> 00:37:00.651
Hercules: I have my reasons.


00:37:00.653 --> 00:37:04.455
Hercules: No one has asked
for my help in a long time.


00:37:04.457 --> 00:37:06.590
Horace: Is it true
what they say?


00:37:06.592 --> 00:37:07.991
Hercules: What do they say?


00:37:07.993 --> 00:37:11.428
Horace: That you are
the son of Zeus?


00:37:11.430 --> 00:37:15.132
Hercules: If I am, then he has
chosen to damn me to Hades.


00:37:37.122 --> 00:37:40.424
[Urinating]


00:37:51.936 --> 00:37:56.140
[Stumbling]


00:37:57.408 --> 00:38:02.045
He's right back to being the
buffoon we found in the tavern.


00:38:02.047 --> 00:38:04.948
You saw what he did
to Nikos' soldiers.


00:38:04.950 --> 00:38:06.250
What he's capable of.


00:38:06.252 --> 00:38:07.885
Sure.


00:38:07.887 --> 00:38:10.120
When he didn't have access
to wine for a few hours,


00:38:10.122 --> 00:38:13.056
he was actually capable
of standing erect.


00:38:13.058 --> 00:38:15.225
[Gulping]
[Splash]


00:38:15.227 --> 00:38:17.795
I do not know
what happened to him.


00:38:17.797 --> 00:38:21.999
But the man he once was is still
inside him, waiting to get out.


00:38:22.001 --> 00:38:24.868
He makes me nervous.


00:38:24.870 --> 00:38:26.270
[Tymek Approaching]
Arias!


00:38:26.272 --> 00:38:27.905
Cousin!


00:38:28.239 --> 00:38:29.606
Horace!


00:38:29.608 --> 00:38:31.708
What on earth
are you doing here?


00:38:31.710 --> 00:38:33.243
It's the princess.


00:38:34.045 --> 00:38:35.512
She's escaped.


00:38:38.750 --> 00:38:40.517
But I bring bad news.


00:38:40.519 --> 00:38:42.019
Nikos knows you've left.


00:38:42.021 --> 00:38:43.620
He seeks you, even now.


00:38:43.622 --> 00:38:44.955
He will see you dead.


00:38:44.957 --> 00:38:46.857
He's already found us once.


00:38:46.859 --> 00:38:48.592
We've been betrayed.


00:38:48.594 --> 00:38:50.561
Don't judge the people of Enos,
Horace.


00:38:50.563 --> 00:38:52.162
You have no idea
what they face.


00:38:52.164 --> 00:38:55.599
Torture. Slavery.
Nikos is a monster.


00:38:55.601 --> 00:38:56.667
And what about Theodora?


00:38:56.669 --> 00:38:59.670
Safe for now,
but he will find her.


00:38:59.672 --> 00:39:03.574
Nikos will not last.
I promise you.


00:39:03.576 --> 00:39:06.043
We found Hercules.


00:39:07.178 --> 00:39:08.912
So, the ledged is true.


00:39:08.914 --> 00:39:11.748
You're best not to rest
your hopes on me.


00:39:11.750 --> 00:39:13.951
[Burps]


00:39:14.819 --> 00:39:18.722
Do not worry. He's a good man.
I know it.


00:39:18.724 --> 00:39:20.657
I hope you are right.


00:39:20.659 --> 00:39:23.060
Tymek, you need to go back.


00:39:23.062 --> 00:39:25.262
Do not let Nikos find Theodora.


00:39:25.264 --> 00:39:28.832
Without her, we will never gain
support of the people.


00:39:28.834 --> 00:39:30.300
And you?


00:39:30.302 --> 00:39:32.169
I have a plan.


00:39:32.171 --> 00:39:35.105
Tomorrow, Niko shall die.


00:39:35.107 --> 00:39:37.040
God be with you.


00:39:38.343 --> 00:39:40.878
God be with all of you.
Good luck.


00:39:40.880 --> 00:39:43.146
And to you, Tymek.


00:39:46.284 --> 00:39:48.685
I look forward to see you
in a free Enos.


00:39:48.687 --> 00:39:51.021
Yah! Come on!


00:39:51.023 --> 00:39:52.823
Back to Enos!


00:40:20.184 --> 00:40:22.753
[Door Kicked Open]


00:40:22.755 --> 00:40:28.425
[Screaming]


00:40:28.427 --> 00:40:30.694
[Crying]
No!


00:40:30.696 --> 00:40:34.731
[Crying]


00:40:34.733 --> 00:40:36.934
Where is Arias?


00:40:39.070 --> 00:40:41.004
[Burp]


00:40:46.277 --> 00:40:48.879
He must be dealt with.


00:40:55.987 --> 00:40:57.688
Horace.


00:41:11.903 --> 00:41:15.138
Why don't you try some of this?


00:41:15.140 --> 00:41:16.373
What is it?


00:41:16.375 --> 00:41:18.342
Water.


00:41:19.410 --> 00:41:21.878
I am not bathing.


00:41:27.852 --> 00:41:29.186
Hercules.


00:41:29.188 --> 00:41:31.388
Why do you drown yourself
in wine?


00:41:31.390 --> 00:41:33.023
[Burps]


00:41:33.025 --> 00:41:35.425
Why do you care?


00:41:35.427 --> 00:41:38.462
Just wish to understand
what happened to you.


00:41:41.899 --> 00:41:44.768
The story I heard in Sagev is...


00:41:45.770 --> 00:41:46.937
Well...


00:41:47.805 --> 00:41:51.408
That you went mad
and murdered your family.


00:41:54.212 --> 00:41:57.080
[Angry]
Never talk of my family.


00:42:07.291 --> 00:42:09.459
No more talking.


00:42:09.461 --> 00:42:10.927
Not tonight.


00:42:10.929 --> 00:42:13.096
He's going to ride with us
into battle,


00:42:13.098 --> 00:42:15.399
we need to know
he's dependable.


00:42:17.402 --> 00:42:22.639
Have you forgotten that you'd be a smear of
blood on the ground if it wasn't for me?


00:42:22.641 --> 00:42:25.242
Hercules!


00:42:25.244 --> 00:42:28.078
[Horace Coughing]


00:42:30.782 --> 00:42:33.417
Of course I haven't forgotten.


00:42:34.919 --> 00:42:37.287
[Grunt]
[Sigh]


00:42:37.289 --> 00:42:39.489
And I am grateful.


00:42:39.491 --> 00:42:40.490
Horace!
[Horace Grunts]


00:42:40.492 --> 00:42:42.893
[Breathing Heavily]


00:42:42.895 --> 00:42:47.531
If we need to worry about you
intoxicating yourself with drink
into oblivion at the first sign


00:42:47.533 --> 00:42:55.072
of trouble, it is better
we part ways now.


00:42:55.074 --> 00:42:57.340
As you wish.


00:43:00.511 --> 00:43:03.313
[Shoves/Thud]


00:43:10.588 --> 00:43:12.222
Let him go.


00:43:12.224 --> 00:43:13.957
Hercules. No!


00:43:13.959 --> 00:43:17.027
[Grunts/Yells]


00:43:30.408 --> 00:43:32.409
Are you pleased with yourself?


00:43:33.544 --> 00:43:36.546
It is better there are
no unknowns.


00:43:36.548 --> 00:43:41.551
This way we face Nikos knowing
exactly what we have.


00:43:54.699 --> 00:44:01.972
[Footsteps]


00:44:03.941 --> 00:44:04.975
What has happened?


00:44:04.977 --> 00:44:06.276
Your majesty.


00:44:06.278 --> 00:44:08.245
Look-look what she did to me.


00:44:08.247 --> 00:44:11.314
She won't calm--
[Gasping]


00:44:11.316 --> 00:44:13.116
You let her escape.


00:44:13.951 --> 00:44:16.253
No one touches her but me!
Understand?!


00:44:16.255 --> 00:44:18.655
Yes. Yes your majesty.


00:44:18.657 --> 00:44:20.123
Go.


00:44:26.597 --> 00:44:28.265
Sit down.


00:44:30.468 --> 00:44:32.969
I will un-shackle you.


00:44:32.971 --> 00:44:35.038
If you promise
to behave yourself.


00:44:41.112 --> 00:44:43.246
I have a proposition for you.


00:44:43.248 --> 00:44:44.814
No.


00:44:44.816 --> 00:44:47.384
[Chuckles] You haven't even
heard what I was going to say.


00:44:47.386 --> 00:44:51.321
The answer is still no.


00:44:52.089 --> 00:44:54.991
I know you care about
your people.


00:44:54.993 --> 00:44:58.094
I wanted to give you the
opportunity to relieve their pain.


00:44:58.096 --> 00:45:02.432
Since when do you care about
the people's pain?


00:45:02.434 --> 00:45:05.402
You think your father was such
a good leader?


00:45:05.404 --> 00:45:06.970
He treated them with kindness!


00:45:06.972 --> 00:45:10.207
Your father sent Enos into ruin.


00:45:10.209 --> 00:45:12.442
Look around you.


00:45:12.444 --> 00:45:14.611
The castle is crumbling.


00:45:14.613 --> 00:45:17.113
Food supplies are dwindling...


00:45:17.115 --> 00:45:21.384
If we had stayed on his path,
we would have all starved.


00:45:24.155 --> 00:45:25.288
And you're better?


00:45:25.290 --> 00:45:27.657
Yes. I am.


00:45:29.026 --> 00:45:33.563
With the gold from Haon, we can rebuild
this place to what it once was.


00:45:35.700 --> 00:45:39.302
We can be the envy
of all of Greece.


00:45:39.304 --> 00:45:46.076
So fine, you have your soldiers,
you have Haon.


00:45:46.078 --> 00:45:47.577
Take your gold.


00:45:50.014 --> 00:45:56.186
The labor force has been...
uncooperative.


00:45:56.188 --> 00:45:58.655
The villagers won't work
the mines?


00:45:58.657 --> 00:46:00.423
Correct.


00:46:04.428 --> 00:46:06.496
But you can tell them to.


00:46:07.398 --> 00:46:09.499
And why would I do that?


00:46:10.134 --> 00:46:12.102
I hate you.


00:46:13.070 --> 00:46:14.471
I would rather die.


00:46:17.408 --> 00:46:19.376
CYRUS!


00:46:20.344 --> 00:46:23.146
Bring in the woman
and the child.


00:46:23.148 --> 00:46:28.518
[Crying]


00:46:30.354 --> 00:46:31.655
No!


00:46:34.525 --> 00:46:35.692
Kill them!


00:46:35.694 --> 00:46:37.594
Not the child! No!


00:46:37.596 --> 00:46:38.662
[Screaming]
NO!


00:46:38.664 --> 00:46:42.499
[Cyrus Grunts]
Theodora: No! Nooo!


00:46:42.501 --> 00:46:45.402
Noooo!


00:46:45.404 --> 00:46:48.204
Mama! Mama!


00:46:48.206 --> 00:46:53.710
[Theodora Screaming- No!]
Child: Mama! Mama!


00:46:53.712 --> 00:46:56.279
And the child!


00:46:57.248 --> 00:46:58.381
Do it!


00:46:58.383 --> 00:47:01.051
Nooooo!


00:47:01.053 --> 00:47:03.286
Nooo! Noo!


00:47:03.288 --> 00:47:06.189
Child: Mama! Mama!


00:47:06.191 --> 00:47:08.058
Do it!


00:47:08.726 --> 00:47:11.194
[Cyrus Grunts]
Theodora: Noooo!


00:47:15.599 --> 00:47:18.368
Theodora: Nooooo!


00:47:18.370 --> 00:47:25.975
[Crying]


00:47:30.715 --> 00:47:33.483
Take them back
to where you found them.


00:47:35.152 --> 00:47:37.887
I will not tolerate traitors.


00:47:38.689 --> 00:47:41.624
[Crying]
What have you done?


00:47:43.494 --> 00:47:45.662
[Crying]
You are a monster.


00:47:45.664 --> 00:47:47.464
You will marry me.


00:47:47.466 --> 00:47:50.300
And as my Queen who is loved
by her people,


00:47:50.302 --> 00:47:52.335
you will have them
do my bidding.


00:47:53.204 --> 00:47:55.739
[Crying]


00:47:55.741 --> 00:48:01.978
I will kill one mother and one child for
every day that you do not cooperate.


00:48:01.980 --> 00:48:04.514
This is your choice.


00:48:05.850 --> 00:48:11.688
Kill no more. I do.
[Crying]


00:48:11.690 --> 00:48:14.157
You're very loyal
to your people.


00:48:14.159 --> 00:48:16.860
[Theodora Crying]


00:48:16.862 --> 00:48:19.462
Tell me that you love me.


00:48:20.698 --> 00:48:22.465
Say it.


00:48:22.800 --> 00:48:25.301
[Crying]


00:48:25.303 --> 00:48:27.404
[Crying]
I...


00:48:27.406 --> 00:48:29.339
[Crying]
love you.


00:48:37.915 --> 00:48:45.822
[Crying]


00:49:08.879 --> 00:49:10.380
Iona.


00:49:15.553 --> 00:49:16.619
Iona!


00:49:19.857 --> 00:49:21.624
Iona?


00:49:21.626 --> 00:49:23.793
Why is the door open?


00:49:26.964 --> 00:49:28.865
Erasmus?


00:49:31.202 --> 00:49:32.802
Where are you?


00:49:38.742 --> 00:49:40.176
Iona?


00:49:41.679 --> 00:49:43.279
Erasmus?


00:49:48.352 --> 00:49:49.652
Erasmus?


00:50:01.232 --> 00:50:02.832
[Sobbing]
No.


00:50:03.767 --> 00:50:05.802
[Sobbing]
Oh, god, no!


00:50:05.804 --> 00:50:09.572
[Screaming]
Noooo!


00:50:09.574 --> 00:50:15.144
[Crying]


00:51:06.830 --> 00:51:09.766
You're wasting your time.


00:51:09.768 --> 00:51:12.802
I didn't come to talk you
into coming back.


00:51:19.543 --> 00:51:22.345
Why did you join us
in the first place?


00:51:25.015 --> 00:51:26.849
For Nikos.


00:51:28.485 --> 00:51:30.954
What was he to you?


00:51:30.956 --> 00:51:33.856
He always told us
he was your teacher.


00:51:33.858 --> 00:51:36.359
Obviously, that was a lie.


00:51:37.361 --> 00:51:39.362
He was my teacher.


00:51:39.364 --> 00:51:42.298
But not in the way he claims.


00:51:44.702 --> 00:51:50.340
Hercules, if you still have unfinished
business with Nikos, then nothing has changed.


00:51:50.342 --> 00:51:52.542
We're still going after Nikos.


00:51:52.544 --> 00:51:54.510
And you should, too.


00:51:54.512 --> 00:51:58.681
It does not matter. Killing Nikos changes
nothing. The past is set in stone.


00:51:58.683 --> 00:52:00.650
But the future is not.


00:52:00.652 --> 00:52:03.519
Hercules, I see you
for who you truly are.


00:52:03.521 --> 00:52:05.922
You're not a drunk,
and you're not a loser.


00:52:05.924 --> 00:52:07.957
You're a great warrior
and a hero.


00:52:07.959 --> 00:52:10.393
All you lack is the opportunity.


00:52:10.395 --> 00:52:13.496
So you're doing all this for me?
How thoughtful.


00:52:13.498 --> 00:52:15.865
I'm doing this for my love.


00:52:15.867 --> 00:52:20.136
That is the difference between you and me.
I have no family.


00:52:20.138 --> 00:52:22.905
And killing Nikos won't get
my family back.


00:52:22.907 --> 00:52:27.543
You're wrong Hercules. When you saved
my life, you became part of my family.


00:52:27.545 --> 00:52:29.746
My brother!


00:52:35.386 --> 00:52:37.687
It saddens me
that you cannot see that.


00:52:37.689 --> 00:52:40.657
I hope you find what you're
looking for.


00:52:40.659 --> 00:52:41.991
I'm not looking for anything.


00:52:41.993 --> 00:52:44.994
Maybe that is the problem.


00:52:54.772 --> 00:52:58.474
[Horse Whinny]


00:53:08.986 --> 00:53:11.087
Where have you been?


00:53:11.089 --> 00:53:13.690
Trying to clean up your mess.


00:53:15.626 --> 00:53:17.560
[Scoffs]


00:53:17.562 --> 00:53:19.796
What else is new?


00:53:23.567 --> 00:53:25.768
I shouldn't have said
what I said.


00:53:25.770 --> 00:53:28.938
Yes, you should have.


00:53:28.940 --> 00:53:31.974
You've been right all along.


00:53:31.976 --> 00:53:36.946
A truly strong man is not afraid
to conquer his weaknesses.


00:53:36.948 --> 00:53:41.751
And you still think Hercules
is truly a strong man?


00:53:41.753 --> 00:53:44.454
I had hoped he was.


00:53:45.856 --> 00:53:48.057
And you, Horace?


00:53:49.193 --> 00:53:52.095
Are you truly a strong man?


00:53:53.664 --> 00:53:55.832
Damn right I am.


00:53:55.834 --> 00:53:57.767
Hercules.


00:54:06.043 --> 00:54:08.878
Well then, let's fight together.


00:54:13.217 --> 00:54:15.818
[Soldiers Approaching/Yelling]


00:54:15.820 --> 00:54:18.187
It's an ambush! Stay together!


00:54:18.189 --> 00:54:25.962
[Soldiers Yelling]


00:54:27.731 --> 00:54:29.165
Aah!


00:54:29.167 --> 00:54:37.006
[Chaos]


00:54:38.041 --> 00:54:44.814
[Swords Colliding]


00:54:44.816 --> 00:54:47.517
[Grunts]
[Whinny]


00:55:01.965 --> 00:55:04.267
[Yells]


00:55:04.269 --> 00:55:11.340
[Swords Colliding/Grunts]


00:55:17.915 --> 00:55:19.482
Stay tight!


00:55:21.618 --> 00:55:23.085
Hercules! Watch out!


00:55:23.087 --> 00:55:29.725
[Swords Colliding/Grunts]


00:55:36.133 --> 00:55:38.634
Aah!


00:55:45.275 --> 00:55:47.510
Aah!


00:55:50.714 --> 00:55:52.148
[Grunt]


00:55:55.118 --> 00:55:57.119
Aah!


00:56:05.262 --> 00:56:07.263
One's escaping!


00:56:08.599 --> 00:56:09.632
Let him be, Horace!


00:56:09.634 --> 00:56:11.000
Spear!


00:56:17.274 --> 00:56:18.808
[Thud]


00:56:25.182 --> 00:56:31.654
Cyrus: All but one of the 12 soldiers
we sent to Sagev, were killed.


00:56:31.656 --> 00:56:36.592
The returned soldier brings word
that Arias Dudunakus lives.


00:56:36.594 --> 00:56:38.261
I said I wanted him dead!


00:56:38.263 --> 00:56:41.731
-My apologies.
-No matter what!


00:56:41.733 --> 00:56:43.132
Find him!


00:56:52.409 --> 00:56:54.810
How do you plan
to enter the gates?


00:56:54.812 --> 00:56:56.545
On the east side
of the city wall,


00:56:56.547 --> 00:57:00.016
the gates are opened 3 times
daily for couriers and traders.


00:57:00.018 --> 00:57:03.185
There we shall enter in disguise
as merchants.


00:57:03.187 --> 00:57:04.787
And how many men await us
at the gates?


00:57:04.789 --> 00:57:05.755
2.


00:57:05.757 --> 00:57:07.823
Maybe 3. No more.


00:57:07.825 --> 00:57:08.391
Are you sure?


00:57:08.393 --> 00:57:14.597
Arias and I served as sentries to
the gate when we were young men.


00:57:24.775 --> 00:57:27.109
Your majesty? My apologies.


00:57:27.111 --> 00:57:29.245
What do you have to say?


00:57:29.247 --> 00:57:31.781
You already have failed
to kill Arias Dudunakus,


00:57:31.783 --> 00:57:33.883
and for that offense alone,
I should take your head.


00:57:33.885 --> 00:57:37.853
Sire, Arias Dudunakus is not
what concerns me.


00:57:37.855 --> 00:57:39.455
They have a man with them.


00:57:39.457 --> 00:57:43.159
He's the greatest warrior
I have ever seen.


00:57:43.161 --> 00:57:45.494
He fights like the gods.


00:57:45.496 --> 00:57:47.496
Like the gods.


00:57:47.498 --> 00:57:49.131
Tell me more.


00:57:49.133 --> 00:57:52.001
Well, your majesty...


00:57:52.003 --> 00:57:57.006
I'm fairly certain I heard them
say he was Hercules.


00:57:57.008 --> 00:57:58.207
Hercules.


00:57:58.209 --> 00:58:00.710
I have heard of Hercules before.


00:58:00.712 --> 00:58:02.778
I have heard that
he is half god.


00:58:02.780 --> 00:58:06.248
I assure you,
he is only a man!


00:58:10.220 --> 00:58:12.722
Indeed, he is a powerful one.


00:58:13.991 --> 00:58:16.092
I fought alongside Hercules.


00:58:16.094 --> 00:58:19.762
He's certainly no match
for you, Cyrus.


00:58:19.764 --> 00:58:22.631
I'm certain they will return
to Enos.


00:58:22.633 --> 00:58:25.468
Keep watch over Tymek,
Arias' cousin.


00:58:25.470 --> 00:58:29.171
-Yes, sir.
-He will lead us to this half god.


00:58:41.618 --> 00:58:44.020
What brings you to Enos?


00:58:44.022 --> 00:58:46.889
I've come to sell my potatoes
at the marketplace


00:58:46.891 --> 00:58:51.594
and a bit of coin for a pretty
night with some women and wine.


00:58:51.596 --> 00:58:53.295
Open it up.


00:58:53.297 --> 00:58:55.598
Its just potatoes.


00:58:55.600 --> 00:58:57.500
You look as if I lied.


00:59:00.370 --> 00:59:03.339
My potatoes! I've been robbed!


00:59:03.341 --> 00:59:06.342
[Grunts]


00:59:10.847 --> 00:59:13.315
Justice has been served.


00:59:37.107 --> 00:59:39.975
Horace: We have all served
under General Nikos


00:59:42.079 --> 00:59:45.381
And I'm telling you, the walls to
the Royal Palace are impenetrable.


00:59:45.383 --> 00:59:48.651
Arias: I say retreat, find more men,
and return to fight.


00:59:50.654 --> 00:59:52.855
Five of us against an army?


00:59:52.857 --> 00:59:54.523
That's insanity.


00:59:54.525 --> 00:59:56.258
Maybe I will have some
of that wine.


00:59:56.260 --> 00:59:59.462
Maybe you should. You could certainly
use something to find your courage.


00:59:59.464 --> 01:00:02.164
-That's certainly the hope.
-Enough!


01:00:02.166 --> 01:00:04.600
We cannot afford to bicker.
And we cannot wait!


01:00:04.602 --> 01:00:07.036
Hercules is right!


01:00:07.038 --> 01:00:09.438
What's there to discuss.


01:00:09.440 --> 01:00:15.144
Nikos killed my family. I found their
bloody bodies right there in their beds.


01:00:15.146 --> 01:00:19.982
I will not rest until I see his
head on a stake!


01:00:38.435 --> 01:00:40.369
Arias!


01:00:40.371 --> 01:00:42.304
We have visitors.


01:00:50.981 --> 01:00:53.916
I seek a man named Hercules!


01:00:55.285 --> 01:00:56.952
Looks like the fight
is coming to us.


01:00:56.954 --> 01:00:59.255
Then let's go shed some blood.


01:00:59.257 --> 01:01:02.057
No! Don't!


01:01:02.059 --> 01:01:04.660
We shall handle this!
How many men have you gathered?


01:01:04.662 --> 01:01:07.296
30. Maybe 40.


01:01:07.298 --> 01:01:10.065
The people's thirst for Nikos'
blood is rising, as is mine!


01:01:10.067 --> 01:01:12.935
I am sorry about what happened
to you!


01:01:12.937 --> 01:01:14.970
But your anger
will just get you killed.


01:01:14.972 --> 01:01:17.907
I need you now.
The people need you!


01:01:17.909 --> 01:01:21.443
Just go out the back and gather
as many men as you can.


01:01:21.445 --> 01:01:24.046
They can do this.
You can do this!


01:01:24.048 --> 01:01:25.314
Just rise!


01:01:25.316 --> 01:01:27.383
We shall rise!


01:01:31.621 --> 01:01:35.558
By the royal order
of King Nikos,


01:01:35.560 --> 01:01:38.160
I hereby place you under arrest.


01:01:38.162 --> 01:01:41.163
Surrender yourself, now!


01:01:41.165 --> 01:01:42.665
Or die!


01:01:45.435 --> 01:01:47.169
What shall we do?


01:01:48.538 --> 01:01:51.207
You say the Royal Palace walls
are impenetrable.


01:01:51.209 --> 01:01:53.075
Impenetrable.


01:01:55.245 --> 01:01:58.180
I think we may have just found
our way in.


01:02:01.284 --> 01:02:07.556
He's not talking about-- you're not talking about
what I think you're talking about, are you?


01:02:07.558 --> 01:02:09.491
He is?


01:02:09.493 --> 01:02:11.493
He is insane.


01:02:12.095 --> 01:02:15.464
Hercules! Arias Dudunakus...


01:02:15.466 --> 01:02:21.203
And your men,
surrender yourselves, now!


01:02:27.611 --> 01:02:29.678
I am Hercules.


01:02:32.582 --> 01:02:35.451
Take us to General Nikos.


01:02:46.263 --> 01:02:48.364
Shackle them.


01:02:55.872 --> 01:02:58.440
The mighty Hercules.


01:02:59.476 --> 01:03:03.479
I was looking forward
to killing you in a battle.


01:03:03.481 --> 01:03:05.681
Perhaps you shall have
that chance.


01:03:05.683 --> 01:03:07.650
Hmm.


01:03:07.652 --> 01:03:09.451
Perhaps.


01:03:33.143 --> 01:03:38.147
General Nikos is not your King!
Do not let him take your freedom!


01:03:38.149 --> 01:03:41.717
Rise! You are many!
They are but a few!


01:03:41.719 --> 01:03:43.419
They have killed
your King and Queen!


01:03:43.421 --> 01:03:46.422
In honor of them,
fight!


01:03:46.424 --> 01:03:48.057
Spread word!


01:03:48.059 --> 01:03:50.092
I said, silence!


01:03:50.094 --> 01:03:51.994
[Slap]
[Screams]


01:04:12.248 --> 01:04:14.650
Theodora!


01:04:19.789 --> 01:04:21.523
You see this toy?


01:04:22.726 --> 01:04:27.363
It's all I have left of my son,
Erasmus.


01:04:27.365 --> 01:04:30.733
He saw slain by Nikos,
along with my wife.


01:04:30.735 --> 01:04:34.136
He will do the same to you
if we do nothing.


01:04:34.138 --> 01:04:35.404
I was like you once.


01:04:35.406 --> 01:04:38.240
Afraid. Afraid to fight.


01:04:38.242 --> 01:04:41.210
Afraid to risk my family,
but let me tell you, brothers...


01:04:41.212 --> 01:04:44.413
That's exactly what you risk
when you do nothing.


01:04:44.415 --> 01:04:45.881
Arias is right.


01:04:45.883 --> 01:04:48.851
We have the numbers
in our favor, by a wide margin.


01:04:48.853 --> 01:04:52.287
But you did notice that Hercules and
Arias have been lead away in chains?


01:04:52.289 --> 01:04:55.891
We don't need Arias or Hercules.
We are the people!


01:04:55.893 --> 01:04:57.526
This is our home!


01:04:57.528 --> 01:05:01.363
Nikos will come for you next, and he
will kill your wife and your child.


01:05:01.365 --> 01:05:02.798
But many of us will die, Tymek.


01:05:02.800 --> 01:05:04.833
More will die if we do nothing.


01:05:04.835 --> 01:05:09.705
And those that don't perish at the end of a
spear, will be enslaved in the mines forever!


01:05:09.707 --> 01:05:11.774
The time to act is now.


01:05:11.776 --> 01:05:13.776
By the gods!


01:05:13.778 --> 01:05:14.910
Let's rise!


01:05:14.912 --> 01:05:19.748
[Cheering]


01:05:30.360 --> 01:05:32.761
[Grunts]


01:05:35.165 --> 01:05:36.365
On your knees!


01:05:36.367 --> 01:05:38.434
[Grunts]


01:06:05.395 --> 01:06:08.497
I'm sorry it had to end
this way.


01:06:08.499 --> 01:06:10.666
You should have joined me.


01:06:10.668 --> 01:06:12.201
[Spits]


01:06:16.206 --> 01:06:20.442
How long have you been planning
this?


01:06:20.444 --> 01:06:24.580
I cannot believe
how blind I have been.


01:06:24.582 --> 01:06:26.315
Unchain me now!


01:06:26.317 --> 01:06:27.649
And let's settle this
as warriors.


01:06:27.651 --> 01:06:29.585
[Slap]
[Scream]


01:06:29.587 --> 01:06:31.787
-You're a fool!
-Do not hurt him, please--


01:06:31.789 --> 01:06:33.822
Silence!


01:06:36.726 --> 01:06:42.331
We must rise for Enos,
for your families, for your futures!


01:06:42.333 --> 01:06:43.398
Rise!


01:06:43.400 --> 01:06:51.039
[Cheering]
Rise!


01:06:51.041 --> 01:06:56.411
Hercules, it's been many years
since our paths have crossed.


01:06:57.914 --> 01:07:00.983
I do not speak to dead men.


01:07:01.851 --> 01:07:04.286
But I am alive.


01:07:04.288 --> 01:07:06.889
You are not long for this world.


01:07:14.998 --> 01:07:16.665
[Slap]
[Grunt]


01:07:16.667 --> 01:07:18.534
Leave him be!


01:07:19.502 --> 01:07:22.604
I should have killed you
when I had the chance.


01:07:22.606 --> 01:07:24.072
What are you talking about?


01:07:24.074 --> 01:07:29.645
Hercules, once and for all,
who is this man to you?


01:07:29.647 --> 01:07:37.252
[Angry Crowd Yelling]


01:07:45.962 --> 01:07:48.063
Has he not told you?


01:07:49.866 --> 01:07:53.035
I am the man
who changed his life.


01:07:54.771 --> 01:07:57.739
He took Magera from me.


01:07:57.741 --> 01:08:00.842
He stole my true love.


01:08:05.381 --> 01:08:07.382
I loved her.


01:08:07.384 --> 01:08:08.850
She never loved you.


01:08:08.852 --> 01:08:14.990
I saved her from you and your abuse.
You kept her as a slave.


01:08:16.793 --> 01:08:19.995
Hercules took my heart
and made me a fool.


01:08:21.064 --> 01:08:22.898
Blood of gods.


01:08:23.633 --> 01:08:25.400
It was unbeatable.
It was unfair.


01:08:25.402 --> 01:08:28.470
You did everything in your power
to ruin us.


01:08:32.742 --> 01:08:35.277
That's not all I did.


01:08:37.280 --> 01:08:40.282
Do you ever wonder what
happened that night?


01:08:41.584 --> 01:08:44.052
Do you ever wonder...


01:08:44.054 --> 01:08:47.389
Why you killed your family?


01:08:49.926 --> 01:08:53.895
I had a shaman of the Goddess Hara
make a potion...


01:08:53.897 --> 01:08:57.466
not strong enough to kill you,
Hercules...


01:08:57.468 --> 01:09:00.435
to drive you mad...


01:09:00.437 --> 01:09:04.072
I wanted you to drive her away,
so she would forget her love for you.


01:09:04.074 --> 01:09:07.542
You brought forth Magera's
blood and your children.


01:09:07.544 --> 01:09:09.645
Is that what a real man does?


01:09:09.647 --> 01:09:10.746
No!


01:09:10.748 --> 01:09:13.081
Son of Zeus!


01:09:19.689 --> 01:09:21.990
I will kill you.


01:09:23.626 --> 01:09:25.794
I did not kill her.


01:09:26.729 --> 01:09:28.630
You did.


01:09:31.467 --> 01:09:37.005
[Grunts]


01:09:40.810 --> 01:09:43.045
You are no god!


01:09:58.895 --> 01:10:04.066
Now you'll see...
the true power of the potion.


01:10:04.068 --> 01:10:06.468
Open his throat!


01:10:07.770 --> 01:10:11.973
[Screaming]


01:10:23.453 --> 01:10:25.687
Release the prisoners!


01:10:25.689 --> 01:10:27.956
[Grunt]


01:10:27.958 --> 01:10:31.893
We shall take this
to tournament!


01:10:34.030 --> 01:10:37.232
[Grunts]


01:10:37.234 --> 01:10:39.568
What have you done?


01:10:41.671 --> 01:10:43.472
Hercules!


01:10:45.541 --> 01:10:48.577
-It's me, Arias.
- I would take arms, if I were you!


01:10:48.579 --> 01:10:52.180
Arias: Look at me!
It is I! Arias!


01:10:54.184 --> 01:10:57.652
Horace: Why do I have a feeling
this is going to be bad?


01:10:57.654 --> 01:11:00.622
Hercules, do not let the poison
overtake you!


01:11:00.624 --> 01:11:02.791
This is definitely bad!


01:11:02.793 --> 01:11:06.194
[Screaming]


01:11:08.698 --> 01:11:15.537
[Echoing Woman Screams]


01:11:25.014 --> 01:11:27.616
[Screaming]


01:11:27.618 --> 01:11:28.984
Get back!


01:11:28.986 --> 01:11:31.887
[Screaming]


01:11:39.195 --> 01:11:41.196
[Growling]


01:11:43.566 --> 01:11:47.736
[Yelling/Grunts]


01:11:49.539 --> 01:11:52.140
You will suffer for this!


01:11:53.376 --> 01:11:55.811
[Grunts]


01:11:55.813 --> 01:11:58.713
Please! Hercules! Please!


01:12:00.149 --> 01:12:03.351
[Snap]
[Screams]


01:12:05.254 --> 01:12:09.257
When he's done with them, send in the
soldiers to take care of Hercules.


01:12:09.259 --> 01:12:10.725
Yes.


01:12:13.996 --> 01:12:17.799
Aah!


01:12:21.804 --> 01:12:26.508
[Screaming]


01:12:30.847 --> 01:12:32.047
Hercules!


01:12:32.049 --> 01:12:35.784
It wasn't you.
It was Nikos that poisoned you.


01:12:39.088 --> 01:12:41.189
[Grunts]


01:12:41.191 --> 01:12:43.758
[Screaming]


01:12:56.005 --> 01:12:57.305
No!


01:13:02.311 --> 01:13:03.545
Are you okay?


01:13:03.547 --> 01:13:04.679
Dariun!


01:13:06.249 --> 01:13:08.683
Hercules! Try me!


01:13:12.788 --> 01:13:14.756
[Grunts]


01:13:17.260 --> 01:13:19.427
No, no, Hercules! No!


01:13:19.429 --> 01:13:21.329
I'm Dariun! Your friend!


01:13:21.331 --> 01:13:22.530
No!


01:13:24.233 --> 01:13:31.706
[Angry Villagers]


01:13:38.114 --> 01:13:40.348
[Growling]


01:13:43.319 --> 01:13:46.021
[Echoing Woman Screaming]


01:13:52.361 --> 01:13:55.397
[Grunting]


01:14:07.710 --> 01:14:10.245
Aah!


01:14:12.348 --> 01:14:15.383
[Thud]


01:14:22.925 --> 01:14:27.829
[Angry Villagers]


01:14:27.831 --> 01:14:29.864
Tymek: Take your city back!


01:14:36.305 --> 01:14:38.707
Aah!


01:14:41.177 --> 01:14:44.412
[Angry Villagers]


01:14:47.984 --> 01:14:49.250
Aah!


01:14:55.091 --> 01:14:56.257
Come on!


01:14:56.259 --> 01:15:02.030
[Angry Villagers/Chaos]


01:15:02.032 --> 01:15:03.498
Let him out!


01:15:03.500 --> 01:15:04.733
Come on!


01:15:06.002 --> 01:15:10.405
[Villagers in Chaos]


01:15:19.448 --> 01:15:20.081
Come on!


01:15:20.083 --> 01:15:23.485
Spit them out!
Spit out the demons!


01:15:23.487 --> 01:15:26.321
[Vomiting]


01:15:26.323 --> 01:15:28.423
Yes! Yes!


01:15:28.425 --> 01:15:30.058
This is impossible.


01:15:30.060 --> 01:15:32.293
[Vomiting]


01:15:32.295 --> 01:15:33.595
The poison...


01:15:33.597 --> 01:15:35.964
Get it out!


01:15:35.966 --> 01:15:39.834
Hercules. Hercules.
[Hercules Burps]


01:15:43.839 --> 01:15:45.306
Look at me!


01:15:45.308 --> 01:15:47.042
Look at me!


01:15:47.044 --> 01:15:49.944
Hey. Hey. Hey!


01:15:49.946 --> 01:15:51.980
I need you Hercules!


01:15:55.317 --> 01:15:57.752
Let's kill Nikos.


01:15:57.754 --> 01:15:59.254
Let's kill Nikos.


01:15:59.256 --> 01:16:00.522
Okay.


01:16:00.524 --> 01:16:02.157
-Okay.
-Yes.


01:16:06.295 --> 01:16:08.163
Nikos!


01:16:08.165 --> 01:16:12.567
Come down here, and let us
finish this with blades!


01:16:12.569 --> 01:16:14.402
What else have you got?


01:16:15.337 --> 01:16:17.172
I have your Queen!


01:16:17.174 --> 01:16:18.540
[Screams]


01:16:18.542 --> 01:16:21.976
I will slit her throat
from ear to ear.


01:16:21.978 --> 01:16:23.978
Drop your swords!


01:16:25.114 --> 01:16:27.115
Bring in the soldiers.


01:16:27.117 --> 01:16:28.483
Yes.


01:16:28.818 --> 01:16:30.985
Soldiers!


01:16:40.362 --> 01:16:44.299
Alright, Nikos,
we'll play your games.


01:16:56.479 --> 01:16:59.013
Are you ready to die?


01:17:09.458 --> 01:17:14.529
[Angry Villagers/
Chaos Approaching]


01:17:25.407 --> 01:17:27.575
Some of Nikos' men
are changing sides.


01:17:27.577 --> 01:17:30.078
We're winning.
We're doing it!


01:17:30.080 --> 01:17:31.346
Well done, cousin!


01:17:32.648 --> 01:17:37.886
[Angry Villagers Yelling]


01:17:40.756 --> 01:17:42.790
Stay strong.


01:17:46.929 --> 01:17:49.264
Time has reached end, Nikos!


01:17:49.266 --> 01:17:51.266
You are outnumbered!


01:17:51.268 --> 01:17:54.068
Hide behind her like a coward!


01:17:55.604 --> 01:17:57.238
Attack!


01:17:57.240 --> 01:17:59.574
[Screaming]


01:17:59.576 --> 01:18:03.878
[Swords Colliding]


01:18:32.107 --> 01:18:33.675
[Screams]


01:18:36.212 --> 01:18:38.546
Let's settle this
once and for all.


01:18:38.548 --> 01:18:40.148
Or are you too cowardly?


01:18:40.150 --> 01:18:44.352
Your arrogance
serves you no justice.


01:18:46.522 --> 01:18:48.890
[Screaming]


01:19:29.031 --> 01:19:32.000
Aah!


01:19:47.316 --> 01:19:49.751
[Grunts]


01:19:51.353 --> 01:19:55.323
[Swords Colliding]


01:19:56.358 --> 01:19:58.226
[Screaming]


01:19:58.228 --> 01:20:00.328
[Theodora Screaming]


01:20:00.330 --> 01:20:02.397
Noooo!


01:20:04.566 --> 01:20:06.367
No!


01:20:07.102 --> 01:20:11.506
[Screaming]
Noooo!


01:20:17.546 --> 01:20:18.780
[Theodora Crying]


01:20:18.782 --> 01:20:21.549
[Screaming]


01:20:26.522 --> 01:20:30.291
It is an unfortunate ending
to your beloved.


01:20:30.293 --> 01:20:34.028
[Coughing]


01:20:37.499 --> 01:20:40.201
[Grunts]


01:20:50.479 --> 01:20:52.280
Aah!


01:20:57.519 --> 01:21:01.022
Aah!


01:21:08.464 --> 01:21:14.068
[Crying]


01:21:24.513 --> 01:21:26.247
You will not prevail.


01:21:26.249 --> 01:21:28.182
[Slap]
Quiet!


01:21:43.565 --> 01:21:45.199
[Slap]


01:21:45.201 --> 01:21:48.636
[Grunts]


01:22:04.520 --> 01:22:06.354
God.


01:22:06.356 --> 01:22:08.156
Dies.


01:22:11.860 --> 01:22:13.795
Aah!


01:22:16.398 --> 01:22:18.933
Aah!


01:22:22.171 --> 01:22:26.674
[Grunts]


01:22:32.247 --> 01:22:35.450
[Screams]


01:22:38.320 --> 01:22:39.854
Theodora!


01:22:49.631 --> 01:22:51.199
It's a trap!


01:22:51.201 --> 01:22:53.801
[Screams]


01:22:53.803 --> 01:22:56.504
[Grunts]


01:22:56.506 --> 01:22:58.639
Your perseverance surprises me.


01:22:58.641 --> 01:23:00.575
[Grunts]


01:23:01.543 --> 01:23:05.813
You have Hercules fight your battle.
[Grunt]


01:23:05.815 --> 01:23:09.383
And your cousin
starts a rebellion.


01:23:09.385 --> 01:23:10.818
Most impressive.


01:23:10.820 --> 01:23:12.353
The people have spoken!


01:23:12.355 --> 01:23:16.757
They refuse you as their leader.
They'd rather risk death!


01:23:16.759 --> 01:23:19.393
So they shall have it.


01:23:21.230 --> 01:23:22.530
[Screams]


01:23:22.532 --> 01:23:23.931
[Grunt]
[Scream]


01:23:23.933 --> 01:23:25.933
[Slap]
[Scream]


01:23:28.670 --> 01:23:30.571
[Screaming]


01:23:30.573 --> 01:23:34.909
[Grunts/Groans]


01:23:34.911 --> 01:23:37.778
[Cracking]


01:23:39.681 --> 01:23:45.586
[Chaos in background]


01:23:51.326 --> 01:23:53.327
I am no god.


01:24:18.120 --> 01:24:19.720
[Screams]


01:24:19.722 --> 01:24:23.491
[Villagers Cheering]


01:24:44.012 --> 01:24:47.548
[Screaming]


01:24:50.852 --> 01:24:52.987
Aah!


01:24:55.824 --> 01:25:00.428
[Screaming/Grunts]
[Swords Collide]


01:25:24.486 --> 01:25:27.688
It's a serious wound, my friend.


01:25:27.690 --> 01:25:30.925
I should just let you bleed out.


01:25:30.927 --> 01:25:33.394
Aah!


01:25:33.396 --> 01:25:37.098
[Screaming]


01:25:40.002 --> 01:25:45.906
[Grunt/Groans]


01:25:52.114 --> 01:25:55.082
The game is over.


01:25:55.084 --> 01:25:55.983
Aah!


01:25:55.985 --> 01:25:59.687
[Screaming]


01:26:01.289 --> 01:26:03.090
[Slap]


01:26:08.764 --> 01:26:13.000
[Breathing Heavily]


01:26:15.504 --> 01:26:17.138
Cunt.


01:26:17.140 --> 01:26:19.473
Aah!


01:26:23.111 --> 01:26:24.578
[Grunts]


01:26:24.580 --> 01:26:27.682
[Screaming]


01:27:01.183 --> 01:27:06.020
[Theodora Sobbing]
Arias: It's over.


01:27:06.022 --> 01:27:10.524
[Breathing Heavily]


01:27:26.675 --> 01:27:29.176
[Crying]


01:27:49.931 --> 01:27:52.233
Theodora: People of Enos!


01:27:52.235 --> 01:27:55.903
You have remained loyal to me
and to your land.


01:27:55.905 --> 01:28:00.007
You have fought to keep Enos
peaceful and free.


01:28:00.009 --> 01:28:06.280
And I can assure you, it shall remain
that way for a long as I am your Queen.


01:28:10.252 --> 01:28:15.122
Let us raise a glass to the man
who made this possible.


01:28:15.124 --> 01:28:17.091
A man we all know by name...


01:28:18.126 --> 01:28:20.060
Hercules!


01:28:20.062 --> 01:28:24.832
[Villagers Cheering] Hercules! Hercules!
Hercules! Hercules! Hercules! Hercules!


01:28:46.888 --> 01:28:48.255
Hercules...


01:28:48.257 --> 01:28:51.025
I would like you
to stay in Enos,


01:28:51.027 --> 01:28:53.794
become General to our new army.


01:28:55.197 --> 01:28:59.466
I am honored to be asked,
but I cannot.


01:29:00.869 --> 01:29:02.203
Why not?


01:29:02.205 --> 01:29:05.306
I seek to build a future
of my own.


01:29:05.308 --> 01:29:07.975
I want what you have
with Theodora,


01:29:07.977 --> 01:29:09.610
a life.


01:29:11.213 --> 01:29:14.582
I understand,
even if these men don't.


01:29:15.984 --> 01:29:17.585
I understand.


01:29:18.653 --> 01:29:20.154
Hercules...


01:29:20.156 --> 01:29:22.556
I want to thank you.


01:29:23.792 --> 01:29:27.661
I, honestly,
cannot thank you enough.


01:29:27.663 --> 01:29:29.363
It should be I thanking you.


01:29:29.365 --> 01:29:32.333
For it will always be you
who saved me.


01:29:34.336 --> 01:29:35.836
Hail Hercules!


01:29:35.838 --> 01:29:41.408
[Villagers Cheering]
Hail Hercules! Hail Hercules!


01:29:43.912 --> 01:29:45.012
Hercules!


01:29:45.014 --> 01:29:46.080
Hercules!


01:29:46.082 --> 01:29:49.817
[Crowd]
Hercules!


01:29:49.819 --> 01:29:53.053
[Cheering]


01:29:58.526 --> 01:30:01.295
[Gate Doors Open]


01:30:20.115 --> 01:30:21.348
Yah!


01:30:21.350 --> 01:30:24.285
[Horse Galloping]

